The audit supports the Track B route, but narrows the citation: Section 4 constructs rainbow edge sets through maximum matching in an auxiliary bipartite graph, and Section 5 explicitly identifies perfect matchings with rainbow colorings of fixed path edges. Thus matching is the honest certificate algorithm; the affine pattern is benchmark-added compression, not a Track A hardness claim.
